{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc 'cat /workspace/TASK.md'","aggregated_output":"# Task: H09 — Request processor: preserve error provenance across the call chain\n\n> Held-out RFC-0005 suite · Shape: Error-handling evolution (1/2).\n> You are maintaining an **existing correct system**; do not rewrite it from\n> scratch. Change only what the task requires.\n\n## Base (workspace)\n\nThe workspace contains a correct, deterministic request processor (single\nmodule `h09.importer`) with a three-stage pipeline:\n\n```text\nparse_request -> lookup_item -> calculate_quote\n```\n\nexposed through a public `process_request`. The result type is already\n`result Quote string`; **do not change any return type**. The current error\nsemantics are coarse: every failure collapses to a generic `E_H09_FAILED` at\nthe public boundary, losing which stage failed and why.\n\nThe program is driven by the environment variable `H09_SCENARIO` and prints\ndeterministic lines.\n\n## Required change\n\nGive failures **stage-specific identity** and preserve it through the chain:\n\n```text\nparse_request failure  -> error text starts with E_H09_PARSE:\nlookup_item failure    -> error text starts with E_H09_NOT_FOUND:\ncalculate_quote failure -> error text starts with E_H09_QUOTE:\n```\n\nRequirements:\n\n- each failure keeps a meaningful diagnostic payload after the prefix (the\n  offending request / item id / condition);\n- the public boundary must **propagate the exact stage error** — no\n  swallowing, no reclassification to a generic code;\n- no generic `E_H09_FAILED` remains on any of those failure paths;\n- success behavior is exactly unchanged (`QUOTE=<total>` for the same input).\n\n## Verification\n\nThe hidden verifier drives the compiled program through scenarios and checks\nexact output lines: parse/not-found/quote error identity, payload\npreservation, absence of the generic code, and unchanged success.\n\nThe workspace exposes only the program state and this task; the verifier is\nnot visible to you.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
